| who wrote the book the origin | Charles Darwin  | [character for dream in Chinese repeated] |
| of species                    |                 |                                           |
| who played the princess in    | Hanna Alström   | [character for dream in Chinese repeated] |
| kingsman secret service       |                 |                                           |

